{"id": "47341", "title": "修炼老公", "author": "白帝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 27, "available": 10, "cover": "files/article/image/47/47341/47341s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47341.htm", "intro": "婚姻是神圣的。晚礼服再高雅也无法媲美女人的婚妙。结果固然非常的重要，但是女人同样注重驾驭男人的整个过程。从婚礼进行曲奏响的那一刻起，她们就开始默默地诵念拿破仑的那句名言：男人通过征服世界来证明自己，女人通过征服男人来表现自身。", "base": "files/article/html/47/47341", "chapters": [{"title": "卷一 曾经沧海", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "6410449.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一节 渴望完美", "file": "6410450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节 激情之舞", "file": "6410451.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节 泪谱心曲", "file": "6410452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节 不和谐的音符", "file": "6410453.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节 帷幕为谁拉开", "file": "6410454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二 温柔的枷锁", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节 拉紧手中的线", "file": "6410456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节 无言的抗争", "file": "6410457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节 蓝色B小调", "file": "6410458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节 仲夏夜之梦", "file": "6410459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节 春华秋实", "file": "6410460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷三 现代寓言", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节 缘起缘灭", "file": "6410462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节 云深不知处", "file": "6410463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节 旋涡中的情感", "file": "6410464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节 一帘幽梦", "file": "6410465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节 渗入血肉的音符", "file": "6410466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八十二章 香气迷人", "file": "6410467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷四 幻想末路", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节 无奈的与无聊的", "file": "6410469.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二节 微斯人，吾谁与归", "file": "6410470.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三节 欲说还休", "file": "6410471.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四节 凭栏望", "file": "6410472.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五节 泪洒荒郊", "file": "64104